* AGASTYA Stage 2 - isolated NC loop status example only
* 5 V logic pull-up; NC auxiliary contact closes to signal ground in healthy state.
* A control pulse opens the modeled contact at 5 ms. This is NOT a safety-rated stop.
VLOGIC VCC 0 5
RPU VCC MCU_STATUS 10k
VTRIP CTRL 0 PULSE(0 5 5m 1u 1u 5m 10m)
SNC MCU_STATUS 0 CTRL 0 SWNC
.model SWNC SW(Ron=0.5 Roff=1G Vt=2.5 Vh=0.1)
.tran 0 20m 0 10u
.end
